  "rawText": "Wayne Alton Parker Date of Birth: August 31, 1947 | Place of Birth: Rougemont, North Carolina | Mother’s Name: Berta Hawley Parker Father’s Name: James Parker, Jr. Birth Order: Second child of six children Occupation: Logistics Administrator responsible to the U.S. State Department for management of U.S. Embassies around the world. I retired from the U.S. Air Force in November, 1991 after 21 years of service. Education: Attended N. C. A&T State University in Greensboro, N.C. Completed several U.S. Military Management and Logistics courses Family Relationship: Husband of Jacqueline Francis Parker Son-In-Law of Eddie Rufus Francis, Sr. Hobbies and Interest: Reading, traveling and working with fatherless boys in my church and community. I also like to spend time with the elderly to hear them talk about “The way it was.” Aspirations: To retire at 55 years of age and work with the youth and elderly.",
